  "text": "A septic client wants to invest more with us. The first thing they asked is if we're staying around. Both of our companies are growing and they're thinking about putting a lot more behind their marketing. Before they did, one of the owners asked about long-term plans and whether all still be the one handling their account. When both sides are growing, the relationship has to be planned on purpose. You can't just assume it will hold. Asking who will be on your account isn't awkward. It's the smartest question you can ask your marketing agency. If you're about to invest more with any agency, ask that first. And if you want to hear how we answer it, send me a message.",
